# Local `act` secrets file template.
#
# Copy to `.secrets` (gitignored) before running `make act`:
#     cp .secrets.example .secrets
#
# `.actrc` points act at `.secrets` (--secret-file .secrets). One NAME=value per
# line, no quotes. The build-free CI requires no secrets.
#
# Real secrets live in GitHub Actions (repository/environment secrets), never in
# this file.
#
# Documented names (uncomment and fill when a workflow needs them):
# CI_ARTIFACTS_DEPLOY_KEY=
